.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ckman-openpgp-certificates-export 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-openpgp\-certificates\-export \- Export the certificate of a key slot
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-openpgp\-certificates\-export\fR [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIKEY\fR> <\fICERTIFICATE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export the certificate of a key slot
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: pem]
Output format
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
pem
.IP \(bu 2
der
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIKEY\fR>
Key slot
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
sig
.IP \(bu 2
dec
.IP \(bu 2
aut
.RE
.TP
<\fICERTIFICATE\fR>
File to write the certificate to (\*(Aq\-\*(Aq for stdout)
